  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hope for Justice Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hope for Justice Ethiopia (HfJ) works with awareness raising and information sharing to local communities and the justice sector to prevent modern slavery. They also work with re-integration of trafficked children by establishing shelters for survivors. The project specifically targets women/girls and children, and gender mainstreaming and gender aggregation is an integral part of the programming.</narrative>
  </description>
